From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Art-Medical <ilan@kamacode.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 08:03:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] imx8mp-var-dart: force AOT dexopt (speed) for installed
 apps

Changes pm.dexopt.* filters from the default speed-profile to speed so
that apps installed via adb install / PackageInstaller are AOT compiled
instead of running in interpreter mode when no cloud profile is shipped
in the APK (which is the common case for in-house apps). Without this,
installed APKs sit in the 'run-from-apk' state where every method is
interpreted + JIT'd on first hit, producing noticeably sluggish UI.

---
 imx8m/dart_mx8mp/dart_mx8mp.mk | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/imx8m/dart_mx8mp/dart_mx8mp.mk b/imx8m/dart_mx8mp/dart_mx8mp.mk
--- a/imx8m/dart_mx8mp/dart_mx8mp.mk
+++ b/imx8m/dart_mx8mp/dart_mx8mp.mk
@@ -504,6 +504,13 @@ PRODUCT_DEFAULT_PROPERTY_OVERRIDES += \
 PRODUCT_PROPERTY_OVERRIDES += \
     vendor.typec.legacy=true

+PRODUCT_PROPERTY_OVERRIDES += \
+    pm.dexopt.install=speed \
+    pm.dexopt.install-fast=speed \
+    pm.dexopt.first-boot=speed \
+    pm.dexopt.boot-after-ota=speed \
+    pm.dexopt.bg-dexopt=speed
+
 # -------@block_multimedia_codec-------
 # Vendor seccomp policy files for media components:
 PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
--
2.34.1

